  "prefLabel": "Env-A 105.38 Type 7 waste",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 105.38 “Type 7 waste” means municipal sewage sludge waste, consisting of residue generated from the processing of raw sludge at a wastewater treatment plant.\n\nSource. #7845, eff 3-8-03 (formerly Env-A 101.293(h)); renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.290), (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading); renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.204), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.206) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
